{"symbol":"SYSTEMATIC","yahoo":"SYSTEMATIC.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Systematic Industries Limited","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Steel","website":"https://systematicindustries.com","about":"Systematic Industries Limited engages in manufacturing and supplying various steel wires and cables in India and internationally. The company offers optical fiber cables; uni tube cable; multi tube cable armoured and unarmoured; all dielectric self supporting cable; and aerial cable. It also provides optical ground wire; aluminium clad steel wire; Zn+ Al alloy coated wires; steel wire products, such as galvanized steel core for acsr conductors, round and flat cable armour, and hot dipped galvanized wire; and wire and wire products, including stay wire, chain link fence, barbed wire for fencing, and welded wire mesh. In addition, the company offers carbon steel, high carbon, mild steel, galvanized iron, and cable armour wires; and aluminium conductor steel-reinforced cable. It serves power transmission, infrastructure, telecommunications, agro-based, and allied industries. Systematic Industries Limited was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-10-01T12:15:19+00:00","quote":{"price":285.55,"prevClose":295.1,"marketCap":637.67,"high52":298.95,"low52":125.0,"pe":26.61,"bookValue":90.26,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":14.88,"shares":2.2331,"insiders":84.95,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-10-01","2025-10-03","2025-10-06","2025-10-07","2025-10-08","2025-10-09","2025-10-10","2025-10-13","2025-10-14","2025-10-15","2025-10-16","2025-10-17","2025-10-20","2025-10-21","2025-10-23","2025-10-24","2025-10-27","2025-10-28","2025-10-29","2025-10-30","2025-10-31","2025-11-03","2025-11-04","2025-11-06","2025-11-07","2025-11-10","2025-11-11","2025-11-12","2025-11-13","2025-11-14","2025-11-17","2025-11-18","2025-11-19","2025-11-20","2025-11-21","2025-11-24","2025-11-25","2025-11-26","2025-11-27","2025-11-28","2025-12-01","2025-